# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/settings/common/
# (quick task 260820-sqd). Mirrors every sibling manifest's own standing
# instruction: any .qml type added here that is NOT declared below becomes
# unresolvable forever, with no load error. Any FUTURE type added to this
# directory MUST be declared in the same commit that creates it.
module qs.modules.settings.common
PageBase 1.0 PageBase.qml
SettingsSection 1.0 SettingsSection.qml
SelectRow 1.0 SelectRow.qml
NavRow 1.0 NavRow.qml
ToggleRow 1.0 ToggleRow.qml
SliderRow 1.0 SliderRow.qml
# InfoRow (quick-260821-6z1 Task 2, PD-07) — non-interactive explanatory
# row, same focusable-marker discipline as every row type above.
InfoRow 1.0 InfoRow.qml
# StackPage (quick task 260825-wj2 Task 1, D-2) — the sub-page host a root
# page wraps itself in when it has drill-in children. An undeclared type in
# a directory carrying a manifest becomes unresolvable forever with no load
# error, per this file's own header — declared in the same commit as the
# type it names.
StackPage 1.0 StackPage.qml
# StepperRow (quick task 260825-wj2 Task 5, D-9) — the sixth row primitive,
# reserved for continuous numeric values with an increment (poll intervals).
StepperRow 1.0 StepperRow.qml
# TextRow (quick-260826-1n9 Task 2, D-10) — the seventh row primitive, a
# first-class editable text field (label/subtext + committed(value)).
# Declared here in the same commit that creates it — an undeclared type
# in a directory carrying a manifest is unresolvable forever with no
# load error, per this file's own header.
TextRow 1.0 TextRow.qml
# WallpaperTile (quick task 260826-pk2) — the wallpaper thumbnail shared by
# WallpaperPage and its category sub-page. Not a row primitive: it carries no
# `focusable`/`rowFocused` marker and is never collected by
# Pages.qml's _collectFocusableRows(), so it does not change any page's
# focusable denominator or its settings-index-check row count.
WallpaperTile 1.0 WallpaperTile.qml
